nd her castmates  got together for a fresh prince reunion  special on hbo max  before hermione granger there was  another big head overachiever  named tapanga lawrence on boy meets  world  [Music]  topanga  danielle fisher was the envy of every  90s kid until the sitcom ended in 2000.  while official had small roles on yes  dear and long shot after the series  ended  she ultimately found that good roles  just weren't coming her way  she took some time off from acting to  earn a psychology degree  worked at bloomingdale's got married  divorced and even received a dui  in 2008 she began to host the dish which  showcased her bubbly personality  more recently danielle reunited with her  old castmates on the boy meets world  sequel series girl meets world  remarried had a baby and has her eyes  set on the director's chair  sadly she didn't end up with ben savage  in real life  but it's nice to see her happy before  wikipedia  preteens had one go-to source of  information  clarissa melissa joan hart explained it  all and we loved every second of it  just when it didn't seem like she could  be any cooler hart took on the lead role  in sabrina the teenage witch  living with her two awesome aunts and  the best talking cat on tv  sabrina used her magical powers to get  through high school  even though those characters were  magical hart says she was only seen as  her iconic rose  and getting parts after sabrina was a  struggle during this frustrating time  she met her husband course of nature  lead singer mark wilkerson the couple  have been going strong ever since  and have three boys together in 2010  hart's acting career took off again  with a co-lead role in melissa and joey  alongside fellow 90s heartthrob joey  lawrence  hart has also been busy in the holiday  movie game as the lead in the sanicon  broadcasting christmas a very merry toy  store a very nutty christmas  christmas reservation and dear christmas  so for now  you can get your holiday cheer on with  melissa joan hart while you hold your  breath for that rumored clarissa  explains it all reboot  and speaking of classic nickelodeon  welcome to good burger home of the good  burger can i take your order  in the 90s you couldn't imagine a better  sketch duo than keenan and kell  we all know keenan thompson went on to  make us laugh every week on snl  but if you're wondering what happened to  the other half of the duo you're not  alone kel mitchell has actually had a  fascinating career since his time on  good burger he's now a voice actor  with his most famous role being t-boned  on clifford the big red dog  in 2019 mitchell also appeared on  dancing with the stars  and ended in second place another  surprising career turn came later in the  year when he announced he'd become a  licensed youth pastor  the father of three rediscovered his  faith after a struggle with drugs and  alcohol  he told people i was trying to figure it  all out on my own  but what i needed to do was turn to him  once i found that clarity with christ  i knew everything would work out lark  vorhees came into our lives as the  extraordinary lisa turtle on save by the  bell  afterwards vorhees made appearances on  shows like the bold and the beautiful  in the house and the parkers  unfortunately she also became part of a  national enquirer's scandal when the  publication claimed that voorhees was  hospitalized due to a cocaine addiction  locke filed a lawsuit suggesting that  she lost work because of their false  claims  she remained out of the limelight even  after the case concluded  and now for all the dirt the national  enquirer hasn't found out yet  here's lisa our galloping gossip  vorhees publicly said she'd like to be  involved with the save by the bell  reboot and those pleas have paid off  as she popped up on an episode of the  show we wish her the same amount of  happiness she brought all of us  in the 90s shane west burst into the tv  scene on the abc family drama once and  again  later leavin